<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs Wednesday actual 111,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs Wednesday actual 111,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's actual hog sales totalled 111,000 versus an estimated 105,000. - USDA</p>
<p>Opening trade Thursday not well established. Early sales of Barrows and Gilts were $.50-1.00 lower than midsession Weds.</p>
